menu "USB host diagnostics"
    config USB_HOST_DIAGNOSTIC_HS_ONLY
        bool "Diagnostic: install only the HS USB host"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
        default n
        help
            Isolate HS controller enumeration/transfer faults from the second
            FS host. Storage on the FS root is unavailable. Bench diagnosis
            only; never use this configuration for a product release.
endmenu
